  "notes": [
    "Six props that open mini-games. After the interact row the object holds its last frame while the mini-game runs; it vanishes only if the game asks.",
    "interact F1 is already an action pose (it is not a copy of idle F1). idle F6 equals idle F1. vanish F1 equals interact F6; vanish F6 is fully transparent.",
    "The dice lift off the ground in interact F1, F2 and F4; keep the pivot fixed.",
    "The pips, card faces, tiles, board pieces and screen picture are fixed illustrations. Playable cards and dice come from the atlases in sprites/games.",
    "Objects are not directional; 'facing' is nominal."
